type: software
title: "bounded-lognorm: bounded lognormal distributions for scipy.stats"
abstract: >-
  The bounded lognormal 2 (BL2) distribution: a smooth, mode/sigma-parametrized
  continuous distribution on a finite interval, implemented as a full
  scipy.stats.rv_continuous subclass with a speed/precision dial.
